⚠️ IMPORTANT (Dynamic per Section)

If questions change per section, update variable:

Dropdown_Section → OnChange:

Set(
    varTotalWidth,
    150 + 120 +
    CountRows(
        Filter(
            'SE Question List',
            Section.Id = Dropdown_Section.Selected.ID
        )
    ) * 110
)


